av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 16:21</div><div class="bub">大概我的 6 点？</div></div></div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 18:35</div><div class="bub">宫格座次你排一下，剧本发给大家排练。</div></div></div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 18:36</div><div class="bub">你也要在。我坐中间。</div></div></div><div class="sysline">第 10 天</div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:00</div><div class="bub">她到了。</div></div></div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:01</div><div class="bub">（转文字）剧本第二幕你校一下，别读太细，错字改了就行。</div></div></div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:12</div><button type="button" class="voice" data-action="voice-play" data-voice="ding:boss:39" data-sec="41" data-who="boss" data-text="合作协议今天过一下，下午我跟投资人那边要用，你让它先合一版，你看一眼就行，别自己从头弄。" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ding">TING</span><i style="height:6px"></i><i style="height:14px"></i><i style="height:9px"></i><i style="height:16px"></i><i style="height:7px"></i><i style="height:12px"></i> 41″</button><div class="trans">转文字：合作协议今天过一下，下午我跟投资人那边要用，你让它先合一版，你看一眼就行，别自己从头弄。</div></div></div><div class="sysline">第 11 天</div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:00</div><div class="bub">Good to see you, .</div></div></div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:00</div><button type="button" class="voice" data-action="voice-play" data-voice="ding:bos