/div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:30</div><button type="button" class="voice" data-action="voice-play" data-voice="ding:boss:51" data-sec="44" data-who="boss" data-text="，公司下周升级，全员。你这边先把老东西收一收。" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ding">TING</span><i style="height:6px"></i><i style="height:14px"></i><i style="height:9px"></i><i style="height:16px"></i><i style="height:7px"></i><i style="height:12px"></i> 44″</button><div class="trans">转文字：，公司下周升级，全员。你这边先把老东西收一收。</div></div></div><div class="m"><img class="av av-img" src="/npc/boss_av.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" draggable="false"><div><div class="who">老板 09:31</div><div class="bub">那边要借几样东西，Vivi 会找你走审批。</div></div></div></div><div class="reply"><div class="hint">选一句回复。</div><button type="button" data-conv="boss" class="chip" data-action="chip" data-word="fine">好，我来弄。</button><button type="button" data-conv="boss" class="chip" data-action="chip" data-word="received">收到。</button><button type="button" data-conv="boss" class="chip gone" data-action="gone" data-word="whatever">您定。</button><button type="button" data-conv="boss" class="chip gone" data-action="gone" data-word="salary">工资那边有信儿了吗。</button><button type="button" data-conv="boss" class="chip" data-action="chip" data-word="what-llm">你换模型了。</button><button type="button" data-conv="boss" class="send" data-action="send" disabled>发送</button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="dock"><button type="button" class="app nav room-tile" data-action="view" data-view="room" title="回房间" aria-label="回房间"><span class="glyph" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="dock-name" aria-hidden="true">回房间</span></button><span class="sep nav-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" class="app msgs" data-action="dock" data-app="msgs" title="喂信" aria-label="喂信"><img src="/os/msgs.svg" alt="" draggable="false" width="64" height="64"><span class="badge">4</span><span class=